                          answer: "We perform professional steam cleaning under controlled high pressure, combined with a powerful extraction system. Heat (200°F), controlled pressure (800-1200 PSI) and industrial suction work together to extract dirt from the bottom of the grout — far beyond a household steam cleaner.",
