                          answer: "We generally use an invisible penetrating sealant that does not change the natural appearance of your grout. It protects from the inside. If you wish to change the color of your grout, there are colored sealants (ColorSeal), but it is a separate specialized service.",
                      },
                      {
                          question: "Do you also clean kitchen backsplashes?",
                          answer: "Yes! We use smaller hand tools, specifically designed for vertical surfaces, to clean your backsplashes and shower walls with the same efficiency as your floors.",
                      },
                      {
                          question: "How often should ceramic tile and grout be cleaned?",
                          answer: "We recommend a professional cleaning every 12 to 18 months depending on usage, pets and traffic level. Regular maintenance helps prevent grout darkening and extends the life of your joints.",
                      },
                      {
                          question: "Are your products safe for children and pets?",
                          answer: "Yes. We use premium eco-friendly professional products suited to family environments. They clean deeply without compromising your ceramic finish.",
                      },
                      {
                          question: "Do you clean condos and apartments in Montreal?",
                          answer: "Yes. We regularly clean tile and grout in condos and apartments across Montreal, Laval and the South Shore. Our closed turbo head limits splashing and works well in more compact spaces.",
                      },
                  ]}
              />
          </div>

          <div class="fade-in-section delay-200" style="margin-top: 2.5rem; max-width: 720px;">
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-text-main);">
              While we are there, many clients also book
              <a href="/en/services/nettoyage-tapis-residentiel/">carpet cleaning</a>
              or
              <a href="/en/services/meubles-tissu/">upholstered furniture cleaning</a>
